###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_850b976f_0726_4408_b1b2_1f0ae367faf6
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_850b976f_0726_4408_b1b2_1f0ae367faf6> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
