###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_06c415dc_ba26_407d_b596_283bd4d9a66f
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_06c415dc_ba26_407d_b596_283bd4d9a66f> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_6ab555fd_5803_4f03_82e8_127c01aabfea> ;
                                                                  rdfs:comment "Joining process by softening the surfaces to be joined, either by heat or with a solvent (swelling welding, solvent welding), and pressing the softened surfaces together." ;
