###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_15db234d_ecaf_4715_9838_4b4ec424fb13
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_15db234d_ecaf_4715_9838_4b4ec424fb13> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                        owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_9953c19f_ee33_4af8_be5e_dbf6d1e33581>
