###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_477042ef_3173_49b2_a264_0e3270733f8c
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_477042ef_3173_49b2_a264_0e3270733f8c> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c29603f5_95e8_42f5_ab0c_f3bcf3166d53> ,
                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_cd2cd0de_e0cc_4ef1_b27e_2e88db027bac> ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "CoherenceLength"@en ;
