###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_81e767f1_59b1_4d7a_bf69_17f322241831
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_81e767f1_59b1_4d7a_bf69_17f322241831> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_2946d40b_24a1_47fa_8176_e3f79bb45064> ,
