                                                                                                                                    "6-30" ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> """Vector quantity μ causing a change to its energy ΔW in an external magnetic field of field flux density B:

    ΔW = −μ · B"""@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_fe015383_afb3_44a6_ae86_043628697aa2> "http://goldbook.iupac.org/terms/view/M03688" .


