###  https://w3id.org/emmo#NewtonSecondPerCubicMetre
<https://w3id.org/emmo#NewtonSecondPerCubicMetre> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_1273eb34_de48_43a9_925f_104110469dd2> ,
