                                                                                                          "rad/min" ;
                                        <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64> "rad/min" ;
                                        <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> """Radian Per Minute (rad/min) is a unit in the category of Angular velocity. It is also known as radians per minute, radian/minute. Radian Per Minute (rad/min) has a dimension of aT-1 where T is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit rad/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.0166666666667.

-- QUDT"""@en .


