###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#CyclicChronopotentiometry
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#CyclicChronopotentiometry> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                             rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#Chronopotentiometry> ;
