###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_b6319c74_d2ce_48c0_a75a_63156776b302
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_b6319c74_d2ce_48c0_a75a_63156776b302> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_0f007072_a8dd_4798_b865_1bf9363be627> ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anode"@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_26bf1bef_d192_4da6_b0eb_d2209698fb54> "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q181232"@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_50c298c2_55a2_4068_b3ac_4e948c33181f> "https://www.electropedia.org/iev/iev.nsf/display?openform&ievref=482-02-27" ;
