                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "by convention, cell electrode at which an oxidation reaction occurs"@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f> "at an anode, electrons are produced in a galvanic cell or extracted in an electrolytic cell"@en ,
